    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/tarball/release/2026-10-05",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/zipball/release/2026-10-05",
    "body": "## Packages Published\n### TypeScript (npm) - published at 14:30:30 UTC\n| Package | Version | Install |\n|---------|---------|--------|\n| @ag-ui/client | 1.0.2 | `npm install @ag-ui/client@1.0.2` |\n| @ag-ui/core | 1.0.2 | `npm install @ag-ui/core@1.0.2` |\n| @ag-ui/encoder | 1.0.2 | `npm install @ag-ui/encoder@1.0.2` |\n| @ag-ui/proto | 1.0.2 | `npm install @ag-ui/proto@1.0.2` |\n\n#### @ag-ui/client@1.0.2\n\n- The client now accepts more optional fields sent as `null` and treats them as absent, with one warning per field per run. Previously these failed the run.\n- Events received before an agent's error (including `RUN_ERROR`) now reach `onEvent` and `onRunErrorEvent` instead of being dropped.\n- HTTP stream cleanup failures no longer mask the original stream error.\n\n##### Breaking changes\n\nNone.\n\n<!-- ag-ui-published: @ag-ui/client@1.0.2 -->\n\n#### @ag-ui/core@1.0.2\n\n- Maintenance release; no consumer-facing changes identified.\n\n##### Breaking changes\n\nNone.\n\n<!-- ag-ui-published: @ag-ui/core@1.0.2 -->\n\n#### @ag-ui/encoder@1.0.2\n\n- Maintenance release; no consumer-facing changes identified.\n\n##### Breaking changes\n\nNone.\n\n<!-- ag-ui-published: @ag-ui/encoder@1.0.2 -->\n\n#### @ag-ui/proto@1.0.2\n\n- Maintenance release; no consumer-facing changes identified.\n\n##### Breaking changes\n\nNone.\n\n<!-- ag-ui-published: @ag-ui/proto@1.0.2 -->\n### Python (PyPI) - published at 16:26:27 UTC\n| Package | Version | Install |\n|---------|---------|--------|\n| ag_ui_antigravity | 0.2.0 | `pip install ag_ui_antigravity==0.2.0` |\n\n#### ag_ui_antigravity@0.2.0\n\n- Added `max_tool_calls_per_turn` to bound the number of tool calls (custom, frontend, and built-in) within a single turn, enforced via a pre-tool-call decide hook.\n- Prevents turns from running tool cycles indefinitely after a client disconnects.\n- Off by default; existing behavior is unchanged unless the limit is set.\n\n##### Breaking changes\n\nNone.\n\n<!-- ag-ui-published: ag_ui_antigravity@0.2.0 -->\n\n\n"
  },
