    "body": "## Packages Published\n### TypeScript (npm) - published at 10:15:13 UTC\n| Package | Version | Install |\n|---------|---------|--------|\n| @ag-ui/client | 1.0.1 | `npm install @ag-ui/client@1.0.1` |\n| @ag-ui/core | 1.0.1 | `npm install @ag-ui/core@1.0.1` |\n| @ag-ui/encoder | 1.0.1 | `npm install @ag-ui/encoder@1.0.1` |\n| @ag-ui/proto | 1.0.1 | `npm install @ag-ui/proto@1.0.1` |\n\n#### @ag-ui/client@1.0.1\n\n- Fixed `connectAgent()` failing when reconnecting to a thread with pending interrupts; connects now read thread history without requiring resume answers.\n- The resume/interrupt check now applies only to inputs that submit answers, allowing reloads to restore interrupted threads.\n\n##### Breaking changes\n\nNone.\n\n<!-- ag-ui-published: @ag-ui/client@1.0.1 -->\n\n#### @ag-ui/core@1.0.1\n\n- Maintenance release; no consumer-facing changes identified.\n\n##### Breaking changes\n\nNone.\n\n<!-- ag-ui-published: @ag-ui/core@1.0.1 -->\n\n#### @ag-ui/encoder@1.0.1\n\n- Maintenance release; no consumer-facing changes identified.\n\n##### Breaking changes\n\nNone.\n\n<!-- ag-ui-published: @ag-ui/encoder@1.0.1 -->\n\n#### @ag-ui/proto@1.0.1\n\n- Maintenance release; no consumer-facing changes identified.\n\n##### Breaking changes\n\nNone.\n\n<!-- ag-ui-published: @ag-ui/proto@1.0.1 -->\n\n\n"
